{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787952513383696711,"compiled_state":{"alias":"flowered-basaltic-beagle","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"0ebdc85eacc0dcd96f5b438871f8edc6b786079caa36afb624ae42b80e2b38ab","event_uuid":"1bb45200-c2ba-4ee4-9a55-56585edbdecc","position":{"commit_sha":"660ae42e7ab6e30217b7e63f21075c89103d2476","position":"1787948588585400001-1bb45200-c2ba-4ee4-9a55-56585edbdecc"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"e60162672004fa0a35c51b974a39214c8b7d129e3b0d2caadc675e196f023326","event_uuid":"50c271ad-bee3-49f6-b3b1-33d1bad76aa3","position":{"commit_sha":"bfaa06ab7a4aeea80f9c92a3bb9b152fd58f4564","position":"1787948599512266001-50c271ad-bee3-49f6-b3b1-33d1bad76aa3"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787948588585400001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"50c271ad-bee3-49f6-b3b1-33d1bad76aa3","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"c0f6-0fc9-fe48-41bc"}],"description":"## Summary\n\nFollow-up split from injurious-pugnacious-azurevase (c0f6-0fc9-fe48-41bc), the class-fix\nfor repo/config-root-derived-from-the-store-path. That ticket landed the behavior-preserving\n`str(tracker)` subset (composer.py / composer_edit.py) and the `str()` half of the AST guard.\nThis ticket covers the DESIGN-JUDGMENT `realpath()`/`abspath()` subset it deliberately deferred,\nbecause each site needs a per-site decision that is NOT behavior-preserving.\n\n## Background — why these are split out\n\nThe `realpath()`/`abspath()`-wrapped variants operate on the STORE's OWN git repo\n(`git -C <tracker>` for sync/branch), so on a relocated store the tracker's parent may\nLEGITIMATELY be the correct root for some reads (`sync.pull`, `tickets.branch` — the store is\nits own git repo) while being WRONG for others (`scratch.base_dir` arguably should follow the\nCODE repo). Resolving each requires either threading `repo_root` through read-path helpers that\ntoday hold only `tracker` (a signature change — not behavior-preserving) or a documented\n`# repo-root-ok:` store-repo sanction. That per-site judgment is why the parent ticket split\nthese out rather than folding them into its behavior-preserving change.\n\n## Candidate sites to triage (confirm live-vs-correct per site, ±10 lines)\n\nConfig reads (decide code-root vs store-root):\n- src/rebar/_engine_support/reads.py:238 — `_sync_disabled(dirname(realpath(tracker)))` -> `compose_config(root).sync.pull`.\n- src/rebar/_engine_support/reads.py:249 — `tickets_branch(dirname(tracker_abs))` -> `tickets.branch`.\n- src/rebar/_engine_support/reads.py:374 — `_load_scratch`: `repo_root = dirname(abspath(tracker))` -> `compose_config(root).scratch.base_dir`.\n\nGit/attribution family (likely legitimate store-repo roots — verify then sanction):\n- src/rebar/_commands/compact_txn.py:523, compact_rebuild.py:138, compact_plan.py:211\n- src/rebar/_commands/fsck.py:252, fsck_tracker_health.py:82/:203/:373\n- src/rebar/_proc.py:141\n- src/rebar/_store/sync.py:311/:312\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] AC#1 — Each `realpath()`/`abspath()` config-read site (reads.py:238 sync.pull, :249 tickets.branch, :374 scratch.base_dir) either resolves `cfg_root` from the CODE repo root (threading `repo_root` where the wrong root would break a relocated store) OR carries a `# repo-root-ok:` sanction documenting why the store's parent is correct for that read. Each decision recorded on this ticket.\n- [ ] AC#2 — Each git/attribution site (compact_*, fsck_*, _proc.py:141, sync.py:311/312) is triaged; if the store-repo root is correct it carries a `# repo-root-ok:` sanction, otherwise it is fixed. Proven by a RED→GREEN test for any behavior change on a relocated store.\n- [ ] AC#3 — Extend `scripts/check_repo_root_from_tracker.py` to also flag the `realpath()`/`abspath()`-wrapped store argument (the parent ticket added only the `str()` unwrap), so the guard becomes airtight for the whole class once every legitimate store-repo site above carries a sanction. Proven by the guard self-test (`tests/unit/test_repo_root_from_tracker_guard.py`).\n\n## Testing\n\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" python -m pytest tests/unit/test_repo_root_from_tracker_guard.py tests/unit/test_relocated_store_repo_root.py -q` — guard flags the realpath/abspath variants; any relocated-store behavior change has a RED→GREEN oracle.\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" python scripts/check_repo_root_from_tracker.py` — green on the fixed tree with all legitimate store-repo sites sanctioned.\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint && make typecheck` — no regressions.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"088b-e4c1-050c-4516","ticket_type":"bug","title":"config-root from store: realpath()/abspath() design-judgment subset + guard extension","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["1bb45200-c2ba-4ee4-9a55-56585edbdecc","50c271ad-bee3-49f6-b3b1-33d1bad76aa3"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787952513383696711,"uuid":"187f7cb7-ef32-4795-960a-b8ee7231e14f"}